 Welcome to the GrgOS live medium.

   grgos-preview     Preview the Hyprland desktop right now (quick look).

   grgos-install     Install GrgOS to disk. The GrgOS installer lets you pick:
                       Desktop  — Hyprland GUI + AI/productivity/trading
                       Security — terminal only, BlackArch ethical-hacking arsenal
                     It sets everything up as GrgOS (bootloader, identity, user).

 After it finishes: reboot, you're logged in automatically, then run

   grgos-setup

 to pull the remaining apps (Desktop) or the full BlackArch toolset (Security).

 Source:  https://github.com/monescuteodor/GrgOS

